# Force LF endings on text we ship into Linux containers or interpret as
# scripts. Windows users with the default `core.autocrlf=true` would otherwise
# get CRLF on these, breaking `git apply` inside the LibreChat build and
# every shell script.
*.patch     text eol=lf
*.sh        text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
